      "position": 4,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "- HashMap底层原理：\n- 数组+链表/红黑树（JDK8），哈希冲突时链表转树阈值=8，退化阈值=6。\n- 扩容优化：2倍扩容，避免重新计算哈希（高位运算优化）。\n- 线程池参数：",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_json/68ccaea5000000001003ed45.json@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
