      "position": 5,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "\"corePoolSize=CPU核心数\"，\n\"maxPoolSize=CPU*2\"，\n\"Queue=LinkedBlockingQueue\"，拒绝策略\n\"CallerRunsPolicy\"（回调主线程执行）。\n- Synchronized vs Lock：",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_json/68ccaea5000000001003ed45.json@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
